  tips:
  - category: COMBAT
    content: Time your Parry with [Right Mouse Button] right before an attack connects
      to stagger foes and recover Spirit.
  - category: COMBAT
    content: Rolling gives you Invulnerability Frames (I-Frames). Use it to evade
      wide slashes and crushing shockwaves.
  - category: COMBAT
    content: Heavy Skeleton Warriors boast thick Poise. Land a complete 3-hit combo
      to break their posture and interrupt their strikes.
  - category: COMBAT
    content: Release your Spirit Blade [E] to strike down archers and skeleton mages
      from a safe range.
  - category: COMBAT
    content: When surrounded by skeletal hordes, unleash the Area Burst [Q] to sweep
      the field clean.
  - category: COMBAT
    content: Keep an eye on your Stamina bar. Running out of breath leaves you defenseless
      against lethal counterattacks.
  - category: EXPLORATION
    content: Shatter barrels and wooden crates with your weapon to find gold coins
      and vital recovery elixirs.
  - category: EXPLORATION
    content: Large labyrinth halls often feature second-floor mezzanines hiding valuable
      treasure chests.
  - category: EXPLORATION
    content: Ancient Shrines radiate a golden aura. Search them thoroughly to obtain
      the Dungeon Key.
  - category: EXPLORATION
    content: Gold coins magnetize towards you automatically when walking nearby.
  - category: EXPLORATION
    content: Wall torches and floor braziers reveal safe corridors and banish dark
      ambushes.
  - category: BOSS TACTICS
    content: The Ice Golem is an unrelenting colossus. Step back when you see its
      fists raised high for a ground slam.
  - category: BOSS TACTICS
    content: When the Frost Juggernaut leaps into the air, time your jump or roll
      just as it impacts the arena floor.
  - category: BOSS TACTICS
    content: Take cover behind the four ancient colosseum pillars to block freezing
      breath and homing purple ice orbs.
  - category: BOSS TACTICS
    content: During the Ice Golem's intro jump-down, keep your distance to avoid
      taking heavy splash damage.
  - category: VILLAGE HUB
    content: Resting at the Village Bell fully restores your Health and recharges
      your spirit for the journey ahead.
  - category: VILLAGE HUB
    content: Visit the Village Blacksmith to enhance your blades and boost your melee
      damage output.
  - category: PROGRESSION
    content: Press [Tab] at any time to inspect your inventory, equip armor, or allocate
      attribute points.
  - category: PROGRESSION
    content: Resetting attribute points costs gold at the Village, but allows you
      to experiment with new combat builds.
  - category: ROGUELITE
    content: If you fall in battle, you will awaken at the Village Bell with the
      rising of a new dawn.
  - category: ROGUELITE
    content: Deeper dungeon floors yield rarer equipment, greater heaps of gold,
      and tougher adversaries.
  locations:
  - sceneName: DungeonScene
    titleFormat: INFINITE LABYRINTH - FLOOR {0}
    subtitle: The Forgotten Crypt
  - sceneName: LandScene
    titleFormat: HAVEN VILLAGE
    subtitle: Sanctuary of the Wandering Knight
